1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:05,240
How the hell did you win playing like that?
You're so in-game.

2
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:10,120
Hey, you look brighter today.
So? How are you?

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,400
Your face looks a lot fresher, man.
Yeah.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,237
Look at him.
That day—you ran off early, right?

5
00:00:15,905 --> 00:00:17,618
Yeah, sorry.

6
00:00:19,471 --> 00:00:22,319
You just disappeared.
Did something happen?

7
00:00:22,319 --> 00:00:25,885
You can tell me, you know.

8
00:00:25,885 --> 00:00:29,464
Come on, dude—
if there's something, tell us already.

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,280
If you wanna know, go ask Gun yourself.
Aren't you two close?

10
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:39,552
Oh f*** off. Close my ass —
I just ran into him by chance.

11
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:44,006
Gun even asked me to look after you.

12
00:00:44,006 --> 00:00:48,182
And that day you vanished God knows where.
I was worried, so I texted him.

13
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,337
So are you two… good now?
Yeah, we're good.

14
00:00:57,569 --> 00:01:03,949
- Good? Great. Then I'm relieved.
- Should I be relieved too? Do I have to be relieved?

15
00:01:04,113 --> 00:01:07,440
Oh—right, I should be relieved too, right?
Yeah okay, I'm relieved.

16
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:10,618
What the hell is wrong with you.

17
00:01:10,727 --> 00:01:13,595
Oh crap, they're checking attendance.
Sh*t!

18
00:01:13,595 --> 00:01:19,892
-Go! Move your ass!
Go to class, idiots.

19
00:01:20,274 --> 00:01:23,047
What the hell, man.
